{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010third In the Ninja kato Series!\u3011</strong></h2>A Side-scrolling 2d Action Game.<br>Robot Ninja kato's Training Is Only Halfway Done.<br><br>This time's training is a competition of running ability with the master!<br>Follow the ninja master while avoiding oncoming cannonballs and kunai!<br>Continue running by using the items found along the course!<br>Overcome various obstacles and receive the master's approval!<br><br>After clearing all stages, Kato will take on an even more difficult stage.<br>When all training is completed, Kato will make new history!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010ITEMS\u3011</strong></h2>There are four items that support Kato.<br>Stop time, increase running power, and become invincible.<br>There are also items that can be obtained through roulette.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878840/extras/8d585109aa5b33b9a940961014b09ec2.avif?t=1720579973\" width=384 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010BIRD\u3011</strong></h2>If Kato grabs the bird and moves, he can aim for a one-shot reversal.<br>If the roulette wheel spins, there's a chance a bird will appear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878840/extras/f3d0d9bda587e74f6e9e3e2dba6c7fa5.avif?t=1720579973\" width=288 height=96 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Genin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2878840/093edc5469beea49e4726d58b2d5968384561abf.jpg"},{"name":"Chunin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2878840/b1a98e38f661eed46a9c6b40ea3f22f7eac4c130.jpg"},{"name":"Genin(\u2606)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2878840/7edaa47b8d59202ca0af41067609b4debcf8ab1f.jpg"},{"name":"Chunin(\u2